varchar)\n\n**2. `dim_date`** (6 columns)\n- `date_id` (date) — primary key\n- `year`, `quarter`, `month` (integers)\n- `month_name` (varchar)\n- `day` (integer)\n\n**3. `dim_location`** (5 columns)\n- `location_key` (integer) — primary key\n- `state`, `country`, `market`, `region` (varchar)\n\n**4. `dim_product`** (5 columns)\n- `product_key` (integer) — primary key\n- `product_id` (varchar)\n- `product_name` (varchar)\n- `category`, `sub_category` (varchar)\n\n**5. `dim_shipping`** (3 columns)\n- `shipping_key` (integer) — primary key\n- `ship_mode` (varchar)\n- `order_priority` (varchar)\n\n**6. `fact_sales`** (12 columns) — the central fact table\n- `sales_key` (integer) — primary key\n- `order_id` (varchar)\n- `order_date` (date)\n- Foreign keys: `customer_key`, `product_key`, `location_key`, `shipping_key` (all integers, linking to the dimension tables above)\n- Measures: `sales`, `discount`, `profit`, `shipping_cost` (all numeric), and `quantity` (integer)\n\n## 🗄️ Staging Schema (1 table — Raw/Flat Data)\n\n**`orders_raw`** (16 columns)\nThis appears to be the source/pre-transformation table, containing a flat, denormalized structure with all order details in one place:\n- Order info: `order_id`, `order_date`, `ship_date`, `ship_mode`\n- Customer info: `customer_name`, `segment`\n- Location info: `state`, `country`, `market`, `region`\n- Product info: `product_id`, `category`, `sub_category`, `product_name`\n- Metrics: `sales` (numeric), `quantity` (integer)\n\n## Summary\nThis schema shows a typical **ETL pipeline design**: raw order data lands in `staging.orders_raw` as a single flat table, and is then transformed/normalized into the `analytics` schema's star schema — with one central fact table (`fact_sales`, holding 12 columns including keys and numeric measures) surrounded by four dimension tables (customer, date, location, product) plus a shipping dimension, enabling efficient analytical querying.", "step_timings": {"write_sql": 3947, "execute_sql": 21, "generate_viz_spec": 2007, "generate_insight": 8881}}}
